<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL/>;
    dc:modified '2023-10-05T14:42:48'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'ECO_FLBBFL'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'ECO_FLBBFL'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A three-channel optical sensor fitted with two single-wavelength chlorophyll fluorometers and a single-angle scattering meter, depth-rated to 2000 m and designed for float applications. The two fluorometers are configured to detect chlorophyll-a fluorescence at 470 nm (excitation) / 695 nm (emission) wavelengths and chlorophyll-a fluorescence at 435 nm (excitation) / 695 nm (emission) wavelengths respectively, whereas the scattering meter (in-water centroid angle of 124 deg) is configured to measure backscattering at 700 nm wavelength. The instrument is part of the Environmental Characterization Optics (ECO) series tools, manufactured by Sea-Bird Scientific.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:R27::ECO_FLBBFL'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL_AP2/2/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL_AP2/2/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/R27/current/ECO_FLBBFL_AP2/>;
    dc:modified '2023-10-05T14:42:48'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'ECO_FLBBFL_AP2'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'ECO_FLBBFL_AP2'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A three-channel optical sensor fitted with two single-wavelength chlorophyll fluorometers and a single-angle scattering meter, depth-rated to 2000 m and designed for float applications. The two fluorometers are configured to detect chlorophyll-a fluorescence at 470 nm (excitation) / 695 nm (emission) wavelengths and chlorophyll-a fluorescence at 435 nm (excitation) / 695 nm (emission) wavelengths respectively, whereas the scattering meter (in-water centroid angle of 124 deg) is configured to measure backscattering at 700 nm wavelength. The instrument is part of the Environmental Characterization Optics (ECO) series tools, manufactured by Sea-Bird Scientific. The sensor is fitted on an APEX float.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:R27::ECO_FLBBFL_AP2'^^xsd:string .
